nces, alongside credit expansion.","implication":"Judge a new credit model by risk-adjusted cohort outcomes and governance, rather than model deployment or loan growth alone.","nextAction":"Use out-of-time tests and licensed-partner governance; compare approvals at fixed expected loss, later realized losses, fairness and collections outcomes.","url":"https://nu.com/en/newsroom/company/nu-holdings-ltd-reports-first-quarter-2026-financial-results","source":"Nu Holdings","limitations":"Issuer statements do not isolate AI's causal effect. Product mix, seasonality and borrower selection can explain changes; Brazilian or Mexican results cannot be assumed in Indonesia."},{"id":"global-update-8","date":"2026-05-14","publishedAt":null,"dateBasis":null,"title":"Nu reports foundation models in credit underwriting","summary":"Issuer results describe NuFormer in production for credit cards in Brazil/Mexico and unsecured lending in Brazil.","implication":"Monitor model governance, loss-vintage outcomes and risk-adjusted credit expansion rather than equating AI deployment with better credit performance.","nextAction":null,"url":"https://international.nubank.com.br/en/newsroom/company/nu-holdings-ltd-reports-first-quarter-2026-financial-results","source":"Original source","limitations":"Analyst interpretation; reported capabilities are not independently validated"}]}